BT /F1 10 Tf 56 388 Td (The webhook delivery certificate was not renewed before its expiration. The certificate had) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 374 Td (been valid for 365 days from issuance. Monitoring and alerting for certificate expiry did not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 360 Td (prevent this incident.) Tj ET
