BT /F1 10 Tf 56 318 Td (The expired certificate was renewed at 09:10 UTC, restoring the ability of the notifications) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 304 Td (service to authenticate with merchant endpoints. The notifications service automatically) Tj ET
